eted":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 9f5309a2a.\n\nNot reproducible in v4.6.dev5.official.f5918a9d3.\n\nBisected to commit c78c3ba894ab3b80079a6249b35d047c6fd0a6c1. CC @DarioSamo @clayjohn \n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev (9f5309a2a) - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Fri, 14 Nov 2025 06:54:20 +0000 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6600 (RADV NAVI23) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13700K (24 threads) - 31.10 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nAt exit, Godot prints these errors:\n\n```\nERROR: Attempted to free invalid ID: 3225520439472 \n   at: _free_internal (servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:6387)\nERROR: Attempted to free invalid ID: 3195455668396 \n   at: _free_internal (servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:6387)\nERROR: Attempted to free invalid ID: 3169685864619 \n   at: _free_internal (servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:6387)\n```\n\nIn a dev build, these look the same except for a space after the ID number, i.e. the resource type is empty.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Run the editor from the console, so its output is visible.\n- Open an empty project using the Forward+ or Compatibility renderer.\n- Close the editor.\n\nRunning the game itself also prints these errors.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAn empty project created from the Project Manager will do.","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_